---
description: Authorized-use and cyber safety guardrails for UASF
globs: **/*
alwaysApply: false
---

- No destructive payloads, covert data exfiltration, reverse shells, or unbounded internet scanning from this codebase.
- Non-local targets require explicit acknowledgement flags or `UASF_ACK=1` after authorization.
- Lab-only tooling (`rate_limit_detection`, aggressive templates) gated by `--lab-mode`.
